  data: {
    LLM: 'All players start at the same time and play the same patience game (e.g. Klondike) on their own layout. There are no turns; everyone plays simultaneously. Legal moves are those of the underlying patience (e.g. build down in alternating color on the tableau, build up in suit on foundations, turn stock as allowed). The first to finish wins.',
    Player: 'All players start at the same time and play the same patience game (e.g. Klondike) on their own layout. There are no turns; everyone plays simultaneously. Legal moves are those of the underlying patience (e.g. build down in alternating color on the tableau, build up in suit on foundations, turn stock as allowed). The first to finish wins.',
    objective: "Be the first player to complete your solitaire layout by moving all cards to the foundations (or otherwise satisfying the chosen layout's win condition).",
    gameplay: 'All players start at the same time and play the same patience game (e.g. Klondike) on their own layout. There are no turns; everyone plays simultaneously. Legal moves are those of the underlying patience (e.g. build down in alternating color on the tableau, build up in suit on foundations, turn stock as allowed). The first to finish wins.',
